    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki kūtūūlwa būtemi Shekemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abimeleki ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yelubaa ūhooya na baamamiye ū mu Shekemu ng'wenūmo, a basīzaye ba ng'wa nina. Ūbawīla a benabo, na a bangī a ba lūdūgū lwa ng'wa nina a bose; ūhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bing'we babūūjagi a banhū ba mu Shekemu gīkī, ‘Angū ūyo gūlī hambū hambū gūlī kinehe ū kū bing'we, kūsugwa na bitūnja bose makūmi mpungatī a ba ng'wa Yelubaa, nūūlū kūsugwa na munhū ūmò dūhū?’ Hama nīyo a bing'we izūkagwi gīkī, ū nene nalī mīlī gwing'we, na mininga ging'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A baamamiye bīhaya ī yenīyī ū mu matū ga bana Shekemu, nabo būbona gīkī īlī hambū hambū abasuge ū wei; būhaya, “Nīyo ū ng'wenūyū ndūgū wise gete a bise.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būūsola na feza kūfuma mu hekalu ya ng'wa mulungu wabo Baali-beliti, ja būdito wa kūkīla a ha kilo īmò; būng'winha. Ū Abimeleki ūjitūmamīla kwega banhū bahūnga būbiza balondeeji bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūja ī Ofla ū kū ng'wa ise, ūūkababūlaga a badūgūye; a bitūnja ba ng'wa Yelubaa abo makūmi mpungatī, a bose pyī ūbabūlaga ng'wikanza līmò lyenīlo; Yotamu dūhū ū ng'witūnja wa kūmalīīja o ng'wa Yelubaa h'ūyo ūpūlūgūka, ūpeela ūūkibisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho pye a banhū ba Shekemu na a ba Beti-milo bikuminga kū ntī ntaale gwalī hihī na ng'hambī ya balang'hani ū mu Shekemu ng'wenūmo; būntūūla ū Abimeleki kūbiza ntemi wabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūsumo lo Yotamu lw'igwaata",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yotamu aho wawīlwa ū mhayo gweenūyo, ūja ūūkalinha kwigūlya ya lūgūlū lwa Gelizimu, ūbahamukīla na ilaka lya higūlya alīhaya, “Nidegelekagi bing'we bana Shekemu, hūna ū Mulungu nang'hwe akūmudegeleka na a bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwise lūmò ī mitī yalī ītogilwe kūtūūla ntemi wayo; hūna yūūgūwīla nzeituni gīkī, ‘Bebe bizaga ntemi wise.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū nzeituni gwenūyo gūshosha gūlīhaya, ‘Ū nene gete nooye kūkenena maguta, ayo gakabinhaga baamulungu na banhū kūkumīlījiwa, naje kū nīmo gwa kwikala nakūyeengeelaga kū būtongi wa mitī dūhū?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mitī yīnga aheneho yūja kū ntiini; yūūgūwīla, ‘Nzugu ūbize ntemi wise.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntiini nago gūshosha gūlīhaya, ‘Ū nene gete nooye kūtwaaja shisuumo shawiza na shinonu gīko, naje kū nīmo gwa kwikala nakūyeengeelaga kū būtongi wa mitī dūhū?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mitī yīnga a henaho yūūkagūwīla nzabibu gīkī, ‘Nzugu ūbize ntemi wise.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū nzabibu gūshosha gūlīhaya, ‘Ū nene gete nooye kūfunya divai īyo īkayejaga baamulungu na banhū, naje kū nīmo gwa kwikala nakūyeengeelaga kū būtongi wa mitī dūhū?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī mitī ī yose yūnoga nose yūlīwīla līntī ly'igwaata gīkī, ‘Nzugu ū bebe ī gete ūbize ntemi wise.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntī gwa magwaata gwīwīīla ī mitī ī yīngī gīkī, ‘Ūlū ng'hana mutogilwe kūnīīta nabize ntemi wing'we, nzūgi mulembeele mu mbeho yaane namulang'hane; alīyo ūlū ītī chene, ni gwizage moto kūfuma ū mu ntī gw'igwaata gwīpembe ī mitī ya Lebanoni.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū, a bing'we ūlū ng'wītile mhayo gwawiza ū kūng'wīta Abimeleki abize ntemi wing'we, nūūlū ng'wang'wītīlile yawiza ū Yelubaa nī kaya yakwe, ūlū mulībona gīkī īyo ng'wang'wītīlile yigeleelile mung'wītīle; lolagi chiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno mumanile gīkī ū baba walī wifunya kūcha na kūpīla kūlwa kūmulwīlīīla, ūweega gete ū būpanga wakwe kūlwa kūmupīja mu nkono gwa Bamidiani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(alīyo ī lelo yenīyī ng'wīgomelaga ī kaya ya ng'wa baba, ng'ūbabūlaga bitūnja bakwe makūmi mpungatī ng'wikanza līmò dūhū, ng'ūng'wīta Abimeleki kūbiza ntemi wa banhū ba Shekemu, ū ng'witūnja wa nkīma ūyo walī atī nke o ng'wa baba; shitange īkī alī ndūgū wing'we). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūlū ng'wang'wītīlaga ū Yelubaa nī kaya yakwe ī mihayo yenīyī ng'wikūjo na ng'holò ngoloku, ī lelo yenīyī ū Abimeleki ni abizage wa kūmuyeja, na a bing'we mubize gīko ū kūlī we! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ītī chene, leki moto gūfume ū mulī Abimeleki gūmukenaagūle a bing'we bana Shekemu na a bana Beti-milo; hama moto gūfume ū mu bing'we bana Shekemu na a bana Beti-milo, gūnkenaagūle ū Abimeleki!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yotamu ūpeela wīnga ūūkiikala Beeli, nguno akang'ogoha ū ndūgūye ū Abimeleki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wilemeelwa mu Shekemu, na kūcha kwa ng'wa Abimeleki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abimeleki aho washisha myaka idatū ayīsugile ī Isilaeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū Mulungu ūtūma ng'holò yabūbi a ha gatī ya ng'wa Abimeleki na a biikaji ba mu nzengo gwa mu Shekemu; bandya kwīta mihayo ya kūbūyuuga ū būsugi wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu akīīta gīko kūlwa kūlīpa shiilī ya mininga ga bitūnja ba ng'wa Yelubaa abo makūmi mpungatī, abo bakabūlagwa. Ū Abimeleki alīpīlwe īyo akīyīīta, na a bana Shekemu abo bakangunanha ū kūbabūlaga a baana ba ba ng'wawe ū Abimeleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a bana Shekemu būtūūla banhū ba kūng'witegeela ū Abimeleki gīkī bankenaagūle; a banhū benabo būlinha kū ngūlū kūng'wibandīīla. Hama būyūbiboneela a bashimīzi babataaja ī shikolo shabo; ū mhayo gweenūyo ūwīlwa ū Abimeleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akigela munhū ūmò lina lyakwe Gaali, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ebedi, ūsaamīla ū mu nzengo gwa Shekemu hamò na baana ba ng'wawe; a bana Shekemu būnsanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyashika ikanza lya kūhūlūla matwajo ga mizabibu, a banhū būja kū malaale gabo būūkahūlūla, biza bīīpandagīla ī mizabibu būbeeja divai; hūna būja mu numba ya ng'wa mulungu wabo būūkīīta shigukulu. Aho balīīlya na kūng'wa, bandya kūnzuma ū Abimeleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwitūlwa ū Gaali ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ebedi wahaya gīkī, “Ī gete ū Abimeleki ng'wenūyū ni naani? Nū Shekemu nang'hwe naani, nose a bise tūbize ha sīlīlī yakwe? Angū, atī ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yelubaa, hama ū Zebu atī ngunanhi wakwe? Hambū hambū ntūmamīlagi Hamooli, ū ise o ng'wa Shekemu! Ī gīsī īlīho nguno kī ī ya kūntūmamīla Abimeleki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo gītī ūlū ni nalī ntongeeji wabo nene a banhū benaba, ninampamile wīnga ho. Ni nang'wīlile ū Abimeleki gīkī, ‘Bakobyage pye a bashilikale bako ūfumīle aha!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nsugi wa nzengo gwenūyo walī Zebu; akapelana no aho wigwa īyo akīīhaya Gaali ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ebedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtūma banhū mu mbisīla kūja Aaluma, būūkang'wīla ū Abimeleki gīkī, “Alīho munhū ūmò, Gaali ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ebedi, wizile ī Shekemu hamò na baana ba ng'wawe, balīgūyuuga noi ū nzengo, gīkī gūkūleme ū bebe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū ū bebe na a banhū bako nzūgi makanza ga būjikū ng'wibande kū masaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī dilū ūlū wela mupuluke ū mu masaka, ng'wize ū kū nzengo; ū Gaali na a banhū bakwe ūlū būfuma kūmanhya nang'ho, ītaga īyo nkono gwako gūlaadūle kwīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana ū Abimeleki na bashilikale bakwe pye a bose būbūūka būjikū, bigabanhya mu magele anè, būja būūkibanda bbīhi nī Shekemu, būlī ng'wene wikala aho akahelelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gaali ng'wana Ebedi akafuma hanze ī dilū, aho alī ha mita gwa nzengo īmīīlile, ū Abimeleki nang'hwe nī libità lyakwe būsangwa bandya kūpuluka ū mu masaka ūmo baalī bibanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahayūbabona ū Gaali ūng'wīla ū Zebu gīkī, “Bebe nalībona banhū balika kūfuma mu ngūlū!” Nang'hwe ū Zebu ūnshokeja alīhaya, “Genayo maamyengeleji ga mu lūgūlū ūlīgikolanīja na banhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwitulwa ū Gaali wahaya hangī, “Bebe ngosha, banhū gete a benabo, nīyo bangī baayūpulukīla na a ha gatī gatī aho; hama n'igele līngī līīlo lyashika līlīfumīīla kū līntī lya mfumu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Zebu ūng'wīla, “Hama yaaja he lūūlū īyo walikalaga wīhaya gīkī, ‘Ū Abimeleki nani nose atūsuge a bise?’ Batī bene a banhū abo walūbadalahaga aba? Jaaga ko lūūlū ūkalwe nabo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana ū Gaali ūfuma ūbatongeela a bana Shekemu kūkilwisha nū Abimeleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abimeleki ūng'heeba ū Gaali ūmpeeja; ū mu būlūgū wenūbo bingī no bakaminyiwa, baaja bakūgwaaga nzīla ngima, kūshisha kū mita gwa kwingīla mu nzengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abimeleki ūshoka Aaluma ūūkikala kwenūko; ū Zebu nang'hwe ūmpeeja ū Gaali na a baana ba ng'wawe bīnga ī Shekemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū kū ntondo yaho a bana Shekemu būfuma hangī kūja ū kū masaka, ūwīlwa ū mhayo gwenūyo ū Abimeleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbasola a banhū bakwe ūja nabo, ūbagabanhya mu magele adatū, būūkibanda kū masaka kūlindīīla; aho wababona a banhū balīfuma ū mu nzengo, ūpuluka ū mu masaka wandya kūbatūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abimeleki na a banhū",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:44",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Na a banhū:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, na a mabità ayo walī nago.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " abo walī nabo būpeela bajile ū kū mita gwa nzengo būūkanyama ho. Hūna a magele ayo abīlī gūūbihoolekela abo baalī ū kū masaka, būbatūla būbabūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū ū lose lwenūlo ū Abimeleki wilwisha nago ū nzengo gwenūyo kūshisha ūgūdima, ūbabūlaga a biikaji ba ng'wene; lelo ū nzengo ūgūkenaagūla gete, hūna ūgwitīīla na mamunhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī yenīyo aho īlīītwa, a banhū ba mu nzengo abo bikalaga mu numba ndīhu ya balang'hani ba Shekemu būpeelela mu hekalu ya ng'wa Eli-beliti, būūkingīla mu numba ya kūbūngīlà,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:46",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kūbūngà:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kūja kwibisa ng'wipandī lya kūpīlīla; ī no no no mu makanza ga būlūgū.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " bilugalīla ng'wenūmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abimeleki ūwīlwa gīkī pye a banhū abo bakiikalaga bbihī nī numba ya balang'hani ba Shekemu bingīlaga ng'wenūūmo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūsola mbasa ūja nabo a banhū bakwe kū lūgūlū lwa Zalimoni, ūūkaseenha ng'hwi, ūjisesela ha mabega. Hūna ūbalagīla a banhū abo walī nabo alīhaya, “Ītagi wangū ūmo ng'wanibona nalīītīla ū nene!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a banhū benabo nabo būseenha ng'hwi, hūna būnondeela ū Abimeleki; būūkajitūlīīla kwīpīndīlīja ī numba ya kūbūngīlà yenīyo, hūna bītiima moto, būboocha pye a banhū abo baalī ng'wenūmo. A banhū abo baalī baapeelela ū mu numba yenīyo baalī gītī shihūmbī shimò bagosha na bakīma; būshila kūcha pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abimeleki wīnga a henaho ūja Tebezi, ūūkagūpīndīlīja mabità ū nzengo gwenūyo ūgūdumīla kūshisha ūgūdima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gatī ya nzengo gwenūyo yalīmo numba ya kūbūngīlà; na lūūlū pye a banhū ba mu nzengo gwenūyo, bagosha na bakīma, būpeelela mo. Bilugalīla ng'wenūmo, būlinha kū kaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abimeleki ūja ū kū numba yenīyo gīkī akīīdumīle nayo, alīyo aho washika a ha nyango gwa kwingīla ū mu ngītīli yaayo gīkī aje akīīpembe moto, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkīma ūmò walī kwigūlya ūng'holomokeja sho ya kūsheela; yūngwīla ha ntwe lūūpaanuka ū lūpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'witana wangū wangū sūmba wamūūkījaga shilanga; ūng'wīla, “Dutaga wangū ū lūshū lwako ū mu shilaalo ūnimalīīje, batizūhaya gīkī, ‘Wabūlagagwa na nkīma.’” Ū ntūmami wakwe ūnchima lūshū ng'hana ūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli aho baabona gīkī waacha ū Abimeleki, bīnga hoi; būlī munhū ūja kaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu ūbiza wanīpa ū Abimeleki ū būbi ūbo akang'wītīla ise kūlwa kūbabūlaga baana ba ng'wawe makūmi mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū Mulungu ūbalīpa na a bana Shekemu kūlwa būbi wabo bose. Ī lizumo lya ng'wa Yotamu ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yelubaa lyūbapandīka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.57"
            ]
          }
        }
